Get your API key at: https://app.accounted.se/settings/api

No API key (or no account yet)? Connect over OAuth instead; the sign-in
screen lets you create the account, and setup continues in the chat:
  claude mcp add --transport http accounted \
    "https://app.accounted.se/api/extensions/ext/mcp-server/mcp?tool_namespace=accounted"
  codex mcp add accounted --url \
    "https://app.accounted.se/api/extensions/ext/mcp-server/mcp?tool_namespace=accounted"
  Claude.ai / Desktop: Settings > Connectors > Add custom connector with that URL.

Add it to your Claude Desktop config:
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "accounted": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "accounted-mcp"],
      "env": {
        "ACCOUNTED_API_KEY": "gnubok_sk_..."
      }
    }
  }
}
